WEBVTT

00:00:27.660 --> 00:00:30.430
can change things.

00:00:30.454 --> 00:00:33.192
Bryan Stevenson:
When people talk about you,

00:00:33.216 --> 00:00:35.138
what do you want them to say?

00:00:37.121 --> 00:00:39.083
[TED Legacy Project]

00:00:40.719 --> 00:00:43.771
[Congressman John Lewis
In conversation with Bryan Stevenson]

00:00:45.133 --> 00:00:50.016
BS: Well, this is such a great honor
for me to be in this room with you,

00:00:50.040 --> 00:00:51.324
to have this conversation.

00:00:51.348 --> 00:00:56.196
I can't tell you what it means to me
to have this opportunity.

00:00:56.220 --> 00:01:00.741
You represent something so precious
to so many of us,